the filter is a try block around everything after it

try {
  chain.doFilter(request, response)      filters 13, 14, controller
}
catch (AuthenticationException e) {
  sendStartAuthentication   ->  entry point   (who are you)
}
catch (AccessDeniedException e) {
  anonymous or remember me? ->  entry point   (prove it properly)
  otherwise                 ->  accessDeniedHandler  (403)
}

nothing is thrown by this filter itself

